Robert doesn't exist.

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:15.640
mean he's a sort of mirage?

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:16.860
That's fantastic!

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:18.460
Nothing so exotic.

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:21.560
I mean merely that he has no official existence.

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:24.390
Somerset House has no record of his birth.

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:27.970
and there is no entry about him in any official records.

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:29.970
until he turns up on the register.

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:34.820
of your school and something else although he is on the register and

