on any official records wouldn't catch me going to school and if Robert can make

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:53.500
things like those pictures his knowledge is far advanced on what any school could

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:59.380
teach him so why does he go he doesn't have to and he doesn't need to

