Well, we've looked into that possibility already.

00:13:04.310 --> 00:13:06.130
No, he isn't. Well, if he was, we'd know.

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:09.470
Of course, there's always the possibility he's an extraterrestrial.

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:10.130
What?

00:13:10.550 --> 00:13:11.910
Someone from another planet.

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:15.340
After all that's happened to me in the last couple of days,

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:17.100
I'm not going to say that that's unbelievable.

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:19.260
Because nothing is anymore.

00:13:20.060 --> 00:13:20.260
Oh

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:06.960
Elizabeth.

