Didn't mean to do it dishonest.

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:42.620
The rest of your teaching career doesn't turn out like this, Elizabeth.

00:16:42.860 --> 00:16:43.460
So do I.

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:45.890
Any news about Todd, Tim?

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:47.190
He is all right, Elizabeth.

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:49.110
I have checked with the medical computers.

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:50.770
He was not badly hurt.

00:16:50.950 --> 00:16:52.630
He's been treated for shock and sent home.

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:54.060
Poor Johnson.

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:55.200
The police will charge him.

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:57.040
But I don't think the kid even knew what he was doing.

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:58.640
I wonder if he could make a court believe that.

00:16:58.840 --> 00:16:59.620
Well, he didn't.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:06.350
be unjust to punish him. He was being controlled, I saw. What did you see, Stephen? Well, as soon as it

